{"1980250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystal Haven", "steam_appid": 1980250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends or random match-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play with others or go solo, you'll collect cute creatures and explore new worlds. Your single-player saves work in multiplayer, so there's no need to start all over if you want to play online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Supports both local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends and random match-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collecting</strong>: As you explore, add new creatures to your vault and raise them into more powerful adult versions that grow slightly larger with each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Battles</strong>: Battle using traditional turn-based attacks or real-time overworld attacks. Play the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Interactions</strong>: Ride, feed, and even breed your creatures to produce rare hybrid types. You can also give them fun hats to wear.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends or random match-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play with others or go solo, you'll collect cute creatures and explore new worlds. Your single-player saves work in multiplayer, so there's no need to start all over if you want to play online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Supports both local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends and random match-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Collecting</strong>: As you explore, add new creatures to your vault and raise them into more powerful adult versions that grow slightly larger with each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Battles</strong>: Battle using traditional turn-based attacks or real-time overworld attacks. Play the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creature Interactions</strong>: Ride, feed, and even breed your creatures to produce rare hybrid types. You can also give them fun hats to wear.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collector featuring four-player split-screen and online multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980250/header.jpg?t=1754286379", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980250/07cf25e4ecc8cf3bda8b3e70668e339d3ac2268a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754286379", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980250/07cf25e4ecc8cf3bda8b3e70668e339d3ac2268a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754286379", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual Core at 2 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requi